```
In `D1`, `ball.y = brick.y + brick.h + 2`. `vy = -100`. `sdt = 0.01 / 4 = 0.0025`.
`ball.y` becomes `brick.y + brick.h + 2 - 0.25 = brick.y + brick.h + 1.75`.
The ball is still colliding!
